      "text": [
        "563 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «لَيْسَ لَكُمْ أَنْ تُعَزُّونَا وَ لَنَا أَنْ نُعَزِّيَكُمْ إِنَّمَا لَكُمْ أَنْ تُهَنِّئُونَا لِأَنَّكُمْ تُشَارِكُونَنَا فِي اَلْمُصِيبَةِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.563 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"It is not for you to offer us condolences, but it is for us to offer you condolences. Indeed, it is for you to congratulate us, because you share in our misfortune”."
        ]
      }
